        punish: 'envoy',
        announce: false
    });
}
!}

= Livorno

In the Teatro Goldoni at Livorno, Moscow's envoys, the Hungarian Mátyás Rákosi and the Bulgarian Christo Kabakchiev, demand that the Italian Socialist Party expel Turati's reformists. Serrati, who leads the majority, will not do it on Moscow's timetable. So the envoys split the party instead. Bordiga walks out with a third of the delegates to found the Communist Party of Italy, and the mass of the Italian socialist workers stays with Serrati, outside the International.

[? if levi_in_party = 1 : Paul Levi was in the hall. He comes home convinced that Rákosi has thrown away a mass party to keep a pure sect. Rákosi has been heard to say that the German party may need a Livorno of its own. ?][? if levi_in_party = 0 : Our delegates come home divided. ?]

- @defend: Defend Serrati's majority in the Rote Fahne.
- @inside: Keep the dispute inside the Zentrale.
- @endorse: Endorse the split.

@defend
subtitle: [? if levi_in_party = 1 : Levi will write it under his own name, and the Central Committee will judge him by it. ?] Zinoviev will be furious.
on-arrival: {!
Q.e21_livorno = 1;
Q.independence += 8;
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 2;
RG.ecci('zinoviev', -8);
!}

[? if levi_in_party = 1 : Levi's articles ?][? if levi_in_party = 0 : Our articles ?] say what many think: you cannot build a communist party by expelling the workers. In the Hotel Lux in Moscow, the articles are translated and underlined.

@inside
subtitle: No public quarrel. Moscow's telegram stays on the table until February.
on-arrival: {!
Q.e21_livorno = 2;
Q.unity += 3;
RG.comply(10);
!}

The Zentrale argues about Livorno behind closed doors, and the Rote Fahne prints only the facts. Rákosi takes the silence for weakness.

@endorse
subtitle: [? if lock_moscow_orders = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Moscow gets what it asked for. Levi will be fighting on ground he has already lost.
choose-if: lock_moscow_orders < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids taking orders from Moscow.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_moscow_orders == 1) {
    Q.unity -= 10;
    Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10;
}
Q.e21_livorno = 3;
Q.lean_offensive += 2;
RG.ecci('zinoviev', 6);
RG.comply(100);
!}

The Rote Fahne salutes the new Communist Party of Italy and condemns Serrati. [? if levi_in_party = 1 : Levi does not sign the article, and everybody notices. ?]
